  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "lbmr: add SRC_ID secure and compression flags for UM 6.17",
  "description": "Added dissection support for LBMR SRC_ID option flags introduced\nin Ultra Messaging 6.17:\n- LBMR_LBMR_OPT_SRC_ID_FLAG_SECURE (0x4000)\n- LBMR_LBMR_OPT_SRC_ID_FLAG_COMPRESSION (0x2000)\n\nThese flags indicate when an Ultra Messaging source is using\nsecure (TLS) transport or compression. The SECURE flag is set\nwhen context use_tls is enabled, and the COMPRESSION flag is\nset when context compression is configured (e.g., \"lz4\").\n\nAlso added LBMR_LBMR_OPT_LOCAL_DOMAIN_FLAG_VIRAL constant for\ncode clarity (functionality already present from commit 50bac292c6).\n\nFixed typo: LBMR_LBMR_OPT_VERSIION_SZ -> LBMR_LBMR_OPT_VERSION_SZ\n\nDisplay filters:\n- lbmr.opt.src_id.flags.secure\n- lbmr.opt.src_id.flags.compression\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
